---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = "Solutions for Promotional Products Distributors | Swishtag";
const description = "Company stores, SAGE-connected Shopify, PunchOut and enterprise automation for promotional products distributors.";
const canonical = "https://cms.swishtag.com/industries/promotional-products-distributors/";
const robots = "index,follow";
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical} robots={robots}>
  <link slot="head" rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/generic-page.css" />
  <main><section class="gp-hero"><div class="gp-wrap"><div class="gp-kicker">For distributors</div><h1>Make company stores easier to launch and easier to operate.</h1><p>Swishtag helps promotional products distributors use Shopify as a flexible commerce layer while keeping the systems and supplier relationships that already matter to the business.</p><div class="gp-actions"><a class="gp-btn primary" href="/book-demo/">Book a demo ↗</a><a class="gp-btn secondary" href="/solutions/">Explore solutions</a></div></div></section><section class="gp-section"><div class="gp-wrap"><div class="gp-section-head"><h2>Do not replace a working stack just to modernize the storefront.</h2><p>The practical approach is usually to keep the core promo systems and add Shopify, middleware or automation where they create a better customer and operator experience.</p></div><div class="gp-grid"><article aria-label="Open Launch a client store" class="gp-card st-clickable-card" data-card-href="/solutions/shopify-company-store/" role="link" tabindex="0"><small>COMPANY STORES</small><h3>Launch a client store</h3><p>Create branded Shopify company stores for repeat ordering, programs, POD, inventory or hybrid models.</p><a href="/solutions/shopify-company-store/">Explore company stores →</a></article><article aria-label="Open Connect approved SAGE data" class="gp-card st-clickable-card" data-card-href="/solutions/shopify-sage-connect-integration/" role="link" tabindex="0"><small>SAGE + SHOPIFY</small><h3>Connect approved SAGE data</h3><p>Reduce the repeated work of moving product information into a client-facing Shopify experience.</p><a href="/solutions/shopify-sage-connect-integration/">Explore SAGE connection →</a></article><article aria-label="Open Control many stores" class="gp-card st-clickable-card" data-card-href="/solutions/enterprise-shopify-automation/" role="link" tabindex="0"><small>ENTERPRISE</small><h3>Control many stores</h3><p>Centralize reporting, routing and automation when the store portfolio becomes too large for manual administration.</p><a href="/solutions/enterprise-shopify-automation/">Explore enterprise automation →</a></article></div></div></section><section class="gp-section alt"><div class="gp-wrap"><div class="gp-split"><div><h2>What this page will cover</h2></div><div class="gp-list"><div>Launch new company-store programs faster.</div><div>Reduce repeated product and order administration.</div><div>Support PunchOut or custom procurement requirements.</div><div>Centralize multi-store visibility as the program grows.</div></div></div></div></section><section class="gp-section"><div class="gp-wrap"><div class="gp-cta"><div><h2>Have a workflow that does not fit off-the-shelf software?</h2><p>Show us the current process. We can help identify the simplest Shopify, integration, or automation approach before you commit to a larger build.</p></div><a class="gp-btn" href="/book-demo/">Book a demo ↗</a></div><p class="gp-note">This page is connected and launch-ready. Detailed sales copy, proof, screenshots and SEO depth can be expanded in the next content pass.</p></div></section></main>
</BaseLayout>
